sequenceDiagram
    participant Bot as EmployeeBot
    participant I as IConversationIntentService
    participant AOAI as Azure OpenAI (gpt-4o-mini)

    Bot->>I: ResolveIntentAsync(userText, history)
    Note over I,AOAI: only the user's text + function defs are sent — no employee data
    I->>AOAI: chat.completions (tools=intents, tool_choice=auto, temp=0)
    alt tool call returned
        AOAI-->>I: finish_reason=tool_calls, function name + args
        I-->>Bot: IntentResult(intent, params)
    else throttled / timeout / no tool call
        AOAI-->>I: 429 / 5xx / plain message
        I-->>Bot: IntentResult(clarify) -> show quick-action buttons
    end
